# Trustee Platform Domain Configuration

The official platform URL is:

```text
https://trustee.cambobia.com
```

The platform serves:

```text
https://paychain.cambobia.com
https://paykh.cambobia.com
```

Use the following production domains:

```text
https://trustee.cambobia.com
https://api.trustee.cambobia.com
https://ops.trustee.cambobia.com
https://treasury.trustee.cambobia.com
https://compliance.trustee.cambobia.com
https://audit.trustee.cambobia.com
https://status.trustee.cambobia.com
```

API base URLs:

```text
https://api.trustee.cambobia.com/api/v1/paychain
https://api.trustee.cambobia.com/api/v1/paykh
https://api.trustee.cambobia.com/api/v1/bank
```

The `/bank` API must only be accessible to approved trustee-bank systems through private connectivity, mTLS, IP allowlisting and signed requests.

PayChain must use only:

```text
/api/v1/paychain
```

PayKH must use only:

```text
/api/v1/paykh
```

PayChain credentials must not access PayKH APIs.

PayKH credentials must not access PayChain reserve or mint-authorization APIs.

The trustee bank’s core-banking credentials must never be exposed to PayChain or PayKH.

## Required Integration Flow

```text
paychain.cambobia.com
          |
          v
api.trustee.cambobia.com/api/v1/paychain
          |
          v
Trustee reserve, mint and redemption controls
          |
          v
Trustee bank core banking
```

```text
paykh.cambobia.com
          |
          v
api.trustee.cambobia.com/api/v1/paykh
          |
          v
Payment confirmation, merchant settlement and program funding
          |
          v
Trustee bank core banking and KHQR services
```

## Railway Configuration

Create Railway custom domains for:

```text
trustee.cambobia.com
api.trustee.cambobia.com
ops.trustee.cambobia.com
treasury.trustee.cambobia.com
compliance.trustee.cambobia.com
audit.trustee.cambobia.com
status.trustee.cambobia.com
```

Map them to:

```text
trustee.cambobia.com
→ trustee-main-portal

api.trustee.cambobia.com
→ trustee-api-gateway

ops.trustee.cambobia.com
→ trustee-operations-portal

treasury.trustee.cambobia.com
→ trustee-treasury-portal

compliance.trustee.cambobia.com
→ trustee-compliance-portal

audit.trustee.cambobia.com
→ trustee-audit-portal

status.trustee.cambobia.com
→ trustee-status-service
```

Internal Railway services must use private networking and must not receive public domains.

Internal services include:

```text
trustee-postgres
trustee-redis
trustee-ledger-engine
trustee-reserve-engine
trustee-bank-adapter
trustee-payment-matcher
trustee-reconciliation-worker
trustee-compliance-worker
trustee-webhook-worker
trustee-reporting-worker
trustee-scheduler
```

## Environment Variables

Configure:

```text
TRUSTEE_PUBLIC_URL=https://trustee.cambobia.com
TRUSTEE_API_URL=https://api.trustee.cambobia.com
TRUSTEE_OPS_URL=https://ops.trustee.cambobia.com
TRUSTEE_TREASURY_URL=https://treasury.trustee.cambobia.com
TRUSTEE_COMPLIANCE_URL=https://compliance.trustee.cambobia.com
TRUSTEE_AUDIT_URL=https://audit.trustee.cambobia.com

PAYCHAIN_PUBLIC_URL=https://paychain.cambobia.com
PAYCHAIN_API_URL=https://api.paychain.cambobia.com

PAYKH_PUBLIC_URL=https://paykh.cambobia.com
PAYKH_API_URL=https://api.paykh.cambobia.com
```

Do not hard-code domain names inside business logic.

Use environment-based configuration with strict startup validation.

## CORS Rules

Allow only approved origins:

```text
https://trustee.cambobia.com
https://ops.trustee.cambobia.com
https://treasury.trustee.cambobia.com
https://compliance.trustee.cambobia.com
https://audit.trustee.cambobia.com
https://paychain.cambobia.com
https://paykh.cambobia.com
```

Do not use:

```text
Access-Control-Allow-Origin: *
```

for authenticated or financial APIs.

## Callback URLs

PayChain callback:

```text
https://api.paychain.cambobia.com/api/v1/trustee/events
```

PayKH callback:

```text
https://api.paykh.cambobia.com/api/v1/trustee/events
```

The Trustee Platform must sign all callbacks.

Callbacks must include:

* Event ID
* Event type
* Event sequence
* Timestamp
* Client ID
* Program ID
* Correlation ID
* Request ID
* Nonce
* Body hash
* Signing-key ID
* Digital signature

## API Documentation

Publish restricted API documentation at:

```text
https://api.trustee.cambobia.com/docs/paychain
https://api.trustee.cambobia.com/docs/paykh
```

Do not expose trustee-bank internal APIs through public Swagger documentation.

## Branding

Use the product name:

```text
Cambobia Trustee Banking Platform
```

Subtitle:

```text
Safeguarding, reserve control and financial assurance for PayChain and PayKH
```

The codebase may use the internal service prefix:

```text
trustee
```

Examples:

```text
trustee-api-gateway
trustee-ledger-engine
trustee-reserve-engine
trustee-payment-matcher
trustee-reconciliation-worker
```



